abstract: >-
  A source-linked snapshot of selected international undergraduate and master's
  admissions catalogues, curated by Agora Scholars. It contains 1,660 catalogue
  units from nine Chinese universities and 100 official source records.
  Catalogue units are not distinct degrees or currently open applications.
  Historical and unknown intake cycles, teaching-language qualifications and
  coverage limits are preserved. Source-check dates are inherited from the
  underlying research record. Rights in university materials remain with their
  respective owners; see the scoped licence.
keywords:
  - China admissions
  - international students
  - undergraduate admissions
  - master's admissions
